{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42388","headline":"奉酬度支陈员外 · 徐铉","name":"奉酬度支陈员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古来贤达士，驰鹜唯羣书。\n非礼誓弗习，违道无与居。\n儒家若迂阔，遂将世情疎。\n吾友嗣世德，古风蔼有余。\n幸遇汉文皇，握兰佩金鱼。\n俯视长沙赋，凄凄将焉如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42388.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42388","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}